OL,5,G0600 Afrodeutsche
OL,6,     FAfrodeutsche brings the best music
OL,7,     Fto your Sunday, and spins some
OL,8,     Fspecial records from her
OL,9,     Fcollection.
OL,10,G0800 Radcliffe and Maconie
OL,11,     FMark and Stuart present a feast of
OL,12,     Fgreat music and chat for weekend
OL,13,     Fbreakfast, including some
OL,14,     Fhighlights from the BBC's recent
OL,15,     Fprog rock Prom.
OL,16,G1000 Cerys Matthews
OL,17,     FCerys welcomes Seu Jorge to
OL,18,     Fdiscuss The Other Side, his first
OL,19,     Falbum in over a decade, while
OL,20,     FJacqui McShee reflects on
OL,21,     FPentangle's legacy and the songs
OL,22,     Fthat shaped her career.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
