OL,5,G1300 Gideon Coe's Finest Hour
OL,6,     FGideon Coe sits in, bringing his
OL,7,     Fown unique taste to Sunday
OL,8,     Fafternoons so expect music from
OL,9,     Fpeople like Magazine, Mum and
OL,10,     FLittle Joey and the Flips.
OL,11,G1600 Jarvis Cocker
OL,12,     FNot the camping type? No worries,
OL,13,     Fjoin Jarvis as he curates a
OL,14,     Fvirtual festival. Stay on the sofa
OL,15,     Fas he takes you from stage to
OL,16,     Fstage with the odd stop for
OL,17,     Fessential refreshments.
OL,18,G1800 SHERELLE
OL,19,     FSHERELLE sits in with a special
OL,20,     Fmix from the late great DJ Randall
OL,21,     Fto mark two years since his
OL,22,     Fpassing.
